## Scenarios

### sections: totals and counts
_A 3-section, 6-slide deck reports the right totals._

#### sums slide_count across all sections to 6

- Verify: sums slide_count across all sections to 6
   - Expected: total_slides(ds) equals `6`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 4 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: sums slide_count across all sections to 6")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
val ds = _sample_deck()
expect(total_slides(ds)).to_equal(6)
```

</details>

